[
  {
    "name": "Team",
    "messages": [
      {
        "sender": "Alex",
        "text": "Morning! What is everyone working on today?",
        "created_at": "2026-09-07T09:00:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Maya",
        "text": "I am simplifying the mobile headers. More room for the conversation.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-07T09:04:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Jules",
        "text": "I will try the new build on my phone after lunch.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-07T09:08:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Sam",
        "text": "I can check the light and dark themes.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-07T09:12:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Alex",
        "text": "Perfect. Let us keep notes here as we go.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-07T09:16:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Maya",
        "text": "The title now stays in the same place across screens.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-07T09:20:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Sam",
        "text": "That already feels calmer.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-07T09:24:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Jules",
        "text": "Small suggestion: keep the common actions close to the conversation.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-07T09:28:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Maya",
        "text": "New build is ready for a quick look.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-08T09:00:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Sam",
        "text": "The message spacing looks good in dark mode.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-08T09:04:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Jules",
        "text": "Long messages wrap nicely too. I tried a paragraph with enough text to take several lines, because a chat should stay comfortable to read without making every message feel like a separate card.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-08T09:08:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Alex",
        "text": "Agreed. We should also test a busy conversation, not just two short messages.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-08T09:12:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Maya",
        "text": "I added a few longer replies for that.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-08T09:16:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Sam",
        "text": "And some very short ones.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-08T09:20:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Jules",
        "text": "Nice 👍",
        "created_at": "2026-09-08T09:24:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Alex",
        "text": "Thanks everyone. I will check the keyboard next.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-08T09:28:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Sam",
        "text": "Good morning! The compact layout feels much better.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-09T09:00:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Jules",
        "text": "I can get to the conversation in one tap now.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-09T09:04:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Maya",
        "text": "Try pulling down from the top to refresh.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-09T09:08:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Alex",
        "text": "That works here.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-09T09:12:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Sam",
        "text": "Could we separate the conversation by day?",
        "created_at": "2026-09-09T09:16:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Maya",
        "text": "Yes. A date divider, then only the time next to each message.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-09T09:20:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Jules",
        "text": "That will make older conversations much easier to scan.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-09T09:24:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Alex",
        "text": "Let us try it with these demo chats.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-09T09:28:00Z"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Design",
    "messages": [
      {
        "sender": "Maya",
        "text": "I put together a few ideas for the navigation.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-07T10:00:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Alex",
        "text": "The quieter version is my favourite.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-07T10:04:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Sam",
        "text": "Same. The mint accent is enough for the selected tab.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-07T10:08:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Jules",
        "text": "Can we keep the labels available when holding an icon?",
        "created_at": "2026-09-08T10:00:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Maya",
        "text": "Yes, the label can stay until you release it.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-08T10:04:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Alex",
        "text": "Let us keep the animation short and smooth.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-08T10:08:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Sam",
        "text": "The shared header spacing looks consistent now.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-09T10:00:00Z"
      },
      {
        "sender": "Jules",
        "text": "I like the three-dot menu on each message.",
        "created_at": "2026-09-09T10:04:00Z"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
